# Triage domain examples — what an ordinary support mail is about

## What to write here

The everyday subjects that arrive at {{ email_address }}: the words a customer
of {{ company_name }} actually uses when they write in. Six to ten lines is
plenty. Use their vocabulary, not the internal product name — the point is to
recognise the mail, not to describe the catalogue.

Where a word is ambiguous, say what it means here. One subject per line:

