## Why it matters

`/cs-triage-mail` reads this before it decides whether an inbound is routine or
needs you. While the list is empty it has no picture of what normal looks like
for {{ company_name }}, so it does one of two things: it escalates ordinary mail
to you until you stop reading the reports, or it treats an unusual request as
ordinary and drafts a confident answer to it. A short list written roughly is
worth more than no list.
